CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F118A1789772636
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G7/22
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, The US Defence Department has said it
OL,6, is conducting a criminal investigation
OL,7, into a subsidiary of British defence
OL,8, contractor Ferranti.
OL,10,FThe US subsidiary, ISC, is at the
OL,11,Fcentre of a crisis which caused
OL,12,FFerranti's shares to be suspended when
OL,13,F#150 million could not be accounted for
OL,15,FFerranti chairman Sir Derek Alun-Jones
OL,16,Fsays his firm may have been the victim
OL,17,Fof serious fraud.
OL,19,FThe Stock Exchange is studying the sale
OL,20,Fof #24 million worth of Ferranti shares
OL,21,Fby Mr James Guerin, former head of ISC.
OL,23,T]CFrom 19-09-89   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
