OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, A French DC-10 carrying 154 people
OL,6, has gone missing just after leaving the
OL,7, capital of Chad in central Africa.
OL,8,F
OL,9,FA spokeswoman for the airline company
OL,10,FUTA, said the DC10 was flying from
OL,11,FBrazzaville in the Congo to Paris when
OL,12,Fit disappeared after a stop over in
OL,13,FN'Djamena.
OL,14,F
OL,15,FAccording to a French Navy spokesman
OL,16,Fradio contact was lost with the DC-10
OL,17,F20 minutes after take-off.
OL,18,F
OL,19,FA French marine patrol aircraft has
OL,20,Fhas left the Senegalese capital of Daka
OL,21,Fto join in the search.
OL,23,T]CFrom 19-09-89   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,119,180,120,250,0,100
PN,11809
