OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, The Birmingham-based travel company,
OL,6, Sunseekers, has gone out of business,
OL,7, leaving many British holidaymakers
OL,8, stranded on the continent.
OL,10,FSunseekers, who specialised in coach
OL,11,Fholidays, shut its offices in Leeds,
OL,12,FHull and Birmingham this afternoon
OL,13,Fwithout warning.
OL,15,FA spokesman for the Association of
OL,16,FBritish Travel Agents said Sunseekers
OL,17,Fwas not registered with ABTA.
OL,19,FIt was also not a member of the Bus and
OL,20,FCoach Council, which represents travel
OL,21,Ffirms specialising in coach tours.
OL,23,T]CFrom 19-09-89   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
