OL,7, From 19 September, BBC1 will carry
OL,8, extra data lines - 10 per field.
OL,9, Modern television sets should not be
OL,10, affected, but viewers who experience
OL,11, problems should contact their dealers.
OL,13, The extra data lines will give a faster
OL,14, Ceefax service in the future, as well
OL,15, as further BBC Datacast information.
OL,17, On 3 October, 11 line tests will be
OL,18, introduced for a period of 4 weeks.
OL,20,FFurther advice is available from your
OL,21,Fdealer or from us on 01-927 5040.
